      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OVATION KEY (1) settled back off the inside but went through her gears strongly to find the frame with a 2 length third (31.29) at Gawler in Grade 6. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Must come into calculations. ROCK IT RONNIE (4) boasts a consistent overall record including three wins from 15 starts, the latest hitting the minor money when second (23.27) over 400m at Mt Gambier. Form here sound including two wins. Expected to feature on best form. SOKAI (2) finished well back at Gawler last time when a 6 length fifth (31.59) but scored three back at Angle Park (30.86). Has placed several times at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from three starts. Expected to give a good account. SHREWD (5) was strongly fancied last time but ran below expectations when fourth (30.98), beaten 5 lengths.",
